  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>Li</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>KCl</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>LiCl</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>K</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext> </mrow> </math> is incorrect since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KCl</mi></math> is less reactive than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LiCl</mi></math>&nbsp;and will not&nbsp;form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LiCl</mi></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Mg</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mi>EDTA</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>excess</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>NaOH</mo></mrow></mover><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Mg</mi><mfenced><mi>EDTA</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> is incorrect since, the charge on the complex will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>KCN</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> is incorrect since, the final complex formed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>."
